abstract: >-
  Working record of a structural investigation of the Voynich manuscript (Beinecke MS 408) by AI
  research agents directed by Simone Systems Research: tested findings with graded evidence, excluded
  explanations, registers of every cited number, and the scripts to reproduce them. Not a decipherment.
keywords: [Voynich manuscript, Beinecke MS 408, quantitative linguistics, undeciphered scripts, reproducibility]
